From 5145fa2fbcdd1fbfd19c2b52505b789bb0b4df3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thailymmo <lalachine2004@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:36:03 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] elansdcp: Add driver for ELAN Match-on-Chip sensors using
 SDCP (04f3:0c4c)

Firmware 3.05 of the ELAN 0c4c sensor only commits templates inside an
SDCP session. The command layout (connect 0x06, reconnect 0x07, enroll
nonce 0x09, enroll commit 0x0a, authorized identity 0x0c) was taken from
the Windows driver; capture, identify and wipe use the existing ELAN MoC
commands from the elanmoc2 driver.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
